IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bata-approvals`

-- Biological Agents and Toxins Act 2005, ss 2, 4, 6 to 11, 13 to 18, 20, 22 to 29, 31 to 33, 35, 37, 38 to 39, 44 to 49, 51, 54, 55, 58 and 59 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_biological-agents-and-toxins-act-2005.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- large-scale production`

