#ASSERT NOT `the purpose is an excluded purpose` `research at a laboratory`

#ASSERT NOT `Parts 3 to 6 apply` `handling in the course of a diagnosis or an autopsy` TRUE
#ASSERT `Parts 3 to 6 apply` `handling in the course of a diagnosis or an autopsy` FALSE

